    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36112" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνστρέφω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turn in</i>:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρθρα ἐνστρέφεσθαι</span>
			<i>turn</i> or <i>move one's</i> limbs, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Dieb.Judic.</u>
				8
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>turn</i> or <i>move in,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηρὸς ἰσχίῳ ἐνστρέφεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.306
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc. loci,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σηκοὺς ἐνστρέφειν</span>
			<i>visit</i> them, f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				300
			</span></i>.</div>
